    "sections": {
        "description": "Cleora is a fast, minimal, editorial blogging theme. Version 2 pairs a calm typographic system with a lightweight, dependency-free front end: no CSS framework, no JavaScript framework, and a design-token architecture that is easy to customize. Built for readable long-form writing, accessible navigation and a block editor that matches the front end."
